  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "解析侧装配",
      "items": [
        "JSON.parseObject 先按 Feature 合并 mask，再 new DefaultJSONParser(input, config, features)，最后 parseObject(clazz, null)",
        "DefaultJSONParser.parseObject 取 config.getDeserializer(type)；JavaBeanDeserializer 直接 deserialze，否则走通用 deserialize 回调"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "序列化侧装配",
      "items": [
        "JSON.toJSONString 建 SerializeWriter 与 JSONSerializer，write(object) 时按运行期 Class 调 SerializeConfig.getObjectWriter",
        "SerializeConfig 缓存 ObjectSerializer；ASM 可用时由 ASMSerializerFactory 生成 JavaBeanSerializer 子类，Android 上默认关闭走反射"
      ]
    }
  ]
